<title>USA: Midwest Cash Grain PM - River basis values weak.</title>
<headline>Midwest Cash Grain PM - River basis values weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basis bids for corn and soybeans in river markets were slightly lower late Tuesday, a continuation of basis weakness in those markets from last week, Midwest grain dealers said.</p>
<p>However, processor bids for corn and soybeans remained firm to unchanged.</p>
<p>Despite strong gains in CBOT soybean futures, dealers said farmer selling of old- and new-crop soybeans remained light. Fieldwork was under way in many areas, diverting farmers' attention away from marketing grain and soybeans, they said.</p>
<p>Basis values are quoted against CBOT futures, cash $/bu.</p>
